#   b "We don't have much to go on. And we don't even know if that gang name is real or not."
    b "Não temos muitas informações. E nem sequer sabemos se o nome dessa gangue é real ou não."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/10_02_The_Group_Meeting.rpy:178
translate brazil lb_ep01_the_group_meeting1_2933227c:

#   v "Real or not, no one gives up on the [private_group] remember?"
    v "Verdadeiro ou não, ninguém desiste do [private_group] lembrar?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/10_02_The_Group_Meeting.rpy:180
translate brazil lb_ep01_the_group_meeting1_7f0a973b:

#   a "And what if we don't have anything to present to [mc_vic_address] the next time he calls us for one of these meetings?"
    a "E se não tivermos nada para apresentar? [mc_vic_address] Na próxima vez que ele nos chamar para uma dessas reuniões?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/10_02_The_Group_Meeting.rpy:182
translate brazil lb_ep01_the_group_meeting1_b161205c:

#   v "Then we give him something else."
    v "Então damos-lhe outra coisa."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/10_02_The_Group_Meeting.rpy:184
translate brazil lb_ep01_the_group_meeting1_2a35dc80:

#   v "Don't worry, we'll figure this out. Together."
    v "Não se preocupe, vamos resolver isso. Juntos."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/10_02_The_Group_Meeting.rpy:187
translate brazil lb_ep01_the_group_meeting1_ed6520d4:

#   v "Girls, would you please excuse me and [y_name]?"
    v "Meninas, por favor, me deem licença e [y_name]?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/10_02_The_Group_Meeting.rpy:190
translate brazil lb_ep01_the_group_meeting1_b2694630:

#   b "Sure thing, [mc_v_address]."
    b "Claro, [mc_v_address]."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/10_02_The_Group_Meeting.rpy:192
translate brazil lb_ep01_the_group_meeting1_e1e84e1b:

#   b "Let's go, [a_name]."
    b "Vamos, [a_name]."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/10_02_The_Group_Meeting.rpy:196
translate brazil lb_ep01_the_group_meeting1_4ff88bb7:

#   v "[y_name], I want you to tell me everything that happened last night."
    v "[y_name] Quero que você me conte tudo o que aconteceu ontem à noite."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/10_02_The_Group_Meeting.rpy:197
translate brazil lb_ep01_the_group_meeting1_aa1723e6:

#   v "But not now."
    v "Mas não agora."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/10_02_The_Group_Meeting.rpy:199
translate brazil lb_ep01_the_group_meeting1_96e2de9e:

#   mc "Okay... When?"
    mc "Certo... Quando?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/10_02_The_Group_Meeting.rpy:201
translate brazil lb_ep01_the_group_meeting1_db6a4389:

#   v "Once [vic_name] leaves, come to my room."
    v "Uma vez [vic_name] folhas, venha para o meu quarto."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/10_02_The_Group_Meeting.rpy:202
translate brazil lb_ep01_the_group_meeting1_4e3f30c5:

#   v "We can talk in private as I'm sure that you don't want [b_name] and [a_name] eavesdropping on our conversation."
    v "Podemos conversar em particular, pois tenho certeza de que você não quer. [b_name] e [a_name] ouvindo nossa conversa às escondidas."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/10_02_The_Group_Meeting.rpy:204
translate brazil lb_ep01_the_group_meeting1_823c6bda:

#   mc "Yeah, good idea."
    mc "Sim, boa ideia."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/10_02_The_Group_Meeting.rpy:206
translate brazil lb_ep01_the_group_meeting1_0aa59289:

#   v "I'll see you shortly, sweetheart."
    v "Te vejo em breve, querida."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/10_02_The_Group_Meeting.rpy:210
translate brazil lb_ep01_the_group_meeting1_16f6ff46:

#   v "Mwah!"
    v "Uau!"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 3/10_02_The_Group_Meeting.rpy:214
translate brazil lb_ep01_the_group_meeting1_591fa664:

#   mc "(Just when I think my life is going to shit, she always seems to have my back...)"
    mc "(Justo quando penso que minha vida está indo para o buraco, ela sempre parece estar me apoiando...)"

